{"id": 79, "forum": "2-plavatelnye-vodoemy", "title": "Плавательный водоём в Нижнем Новгороде (Сергач)", "posts": [{"id": 642, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-16", "html": "<p>Нам прислали проект бани, около которой заказчик хочет построить водоём.<br>Проект необычен своей формой. <br>Проанализировав проект и ландшафт, мы предложили построить плавательный водоём такой формы, которая будет подчёркивать и дополнять конструктивные особенности бани.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_ce18e56b19c8e47ac5702ba4dd5f0508", "thumb": "", "name": "nn003.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_69977f6f3e48cd95bacee7609579f6ba", "thumb": "", "name": "nn002.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_76cfb2ba67c93b5a8e62e0d395bef233", "thumb": "", "name": "nn001.jpg"}]}, {"id": 643, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-16", "html": "<p>Предложенный нами эскиз</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_1c0334fbfca04d70e6428805859f5b24", "thumb": "", "name": "nn005.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1f5cdd864e880a60a0272ad50b4c9237", "thumb": "", "name": "nn004.jpg"}]}, {"id": 644, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-16", "html": "<p>Начинаем строительство.</p><p>Произведена разметка водоёма на местности</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_446b1672f2031cdff61858681b98a477", "thumb": "", "name": "nn008.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_250174e864ff73e7e9a63d166483bffe", "thumb": "", "name": "nn007.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3b614c3d8c072b5d18916b665e357a59", "thumb": "", "name": "nn006.jpg"}]}, {"id": 655, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-23", "html": "<p>Произведена выемка грунта, подготовлен котлован плавательной чаши</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_120a1f3690dd7f7859e1ba02af037101", "thumb": "", "name": "nn012.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_67672c5341e5821dbedf48237a03e819", "thumb": "", "name": "nn011.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3e33dc48a0f2d1edb0a0ca9cd028997b", "thumb": "", "name": "nn010.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_a719a308ee32f06863dc363bcedf0540", "thumb": "", "name": "nn009.jpg"}]}, {"id": 658, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-25", "html": "<p>Откопала зона регенерации и место установки настила. Идёт подготовка под заливку плиты плавательной чаши и чаши садового аквариума.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_49257a632b3ed62f76714a6c99582982", "thumb": "", "name": "nn017.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_45dc6aa1f38235347fc4ed64ef6e9bab", "thumb": "", "name": "nn016.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_a592f2c2965f3a70dc7d122ae272fbe0", "thumb": "", "name": "nn015.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9245be316162837a8b13e6e30a5ed3e5", "thumb": "", "name": "nn014.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_1072e2509465b056de59167a30f3803b", "thumb": "", "name": "nn013.jpg"}]}, {"id": 659, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-27", "html": "<p>Подготовка опалубки для заливки плит. Вязка каркаса из арматуры.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_0ee4c17317660fec77c54cdfd4ff942c", "thumb": "", "name": "nn019.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fa7cbf23642bb95710e5c2045061563a", "thumb": "", "name": "nn018.jpg"}]}, {"id": 662, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-06-30", "html": "<p>Залита плита садового аквариума. Идёт подготовка к заливке плиты плавательной чаши.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_ade61f8cf7e8adad37d968d115eccf70", "thumb": "", "name": "nn022.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_073f3e8bd2c3e070b1a63f9f1fd03fc7", "thumb": "", "name": "nn021.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f5bc9e92e2e76e0c78eb28b29f24cb15", "thumb": "", "name": "nn020.jpg"}]}, {"id": 665, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-01", "html": "<p>Залита плита основания плавательной чаши</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_a7c2df02e0f76ac0d7dbc0f6b504f1b0", "thumb": "", "name": "nn024.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9ccc7ac467a3e65b179171cd881ac6b9", "thumb": "", "name": "nn023.jpg"}]}, {"id": 667, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-03", "html": "<p>Начато строительство стен водоема для рыб (садового аквариума)</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f21e94ddff24db2d7072843b8bba4192", "thumb": "", "name": "nn026.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ec29843cf06b6b83718fe24df0ace290", "thumb": "", "name": "nn025.jpg"}]}, {"id": 670, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-07", "html": "<p>Начато строительство стен плавательной чаши.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_4a99eeeebba19561aaedf23cba5836e8", "thumb": "", "name": "nn028.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b58e828471bbf7f9f3cf3639555830d6", "thumb": "", "name": "nn027.jpg"}]}, {"id": 674, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-11", "html": "<p>Строиться плавательная чаша и ведётся формирование зоны регенерации в садовом аквариуме.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f27e08817c8ece00757d86012d344088", "thumb": "", "name": "nn032.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_181d92831c82919e182f65c4ba267780", "thumb": "", "name": "nn031.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_b8f4fb34ad756fa67d0bfe49718c78af", "thumb": "", "name": "nn030.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_67b054734b532ef54c904d10f8f16937", "thumb": "", "name": "nn029.jpg"}]}, {"id": 706, "author": "Дмитрий Петров", "date": "2014-07-27", "html": "<p>Закончено строительство плавательной чаши и чаша садового аквариума.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/58_f5939b955a43a8c0ba52dd9cdbbb9043", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG_20140722_181151.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/58_3f6218ccd5767583b2f22fa884ca6836", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG_20140722_181118.jpg"}]}, {"id": 707, "author": "Дмитрий Петров", "date": "2014-07-27", "html": "<p>Распределительный коллектор для подключения подводного пылесоса (забор/подача).</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/58_8140c3e74f9030d8255030f9db514ee3", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG_20140722_181054.jpg"}]}, {"id": 708, "author": "Дмитрий Петров", "date": "2014-07-27", "html": "<p>Заливается фундамент для биоплато водоёма для рыб.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/58_e36db5c649755c2f456be08bd348b2e4", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG_20140724_155815.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/58_e1900ad4b3db0f1b6e38a3bee94174d2", "thumb": "", "name": "IMG_20140724_155856.jpg"}]}, {"id": 715, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-29", "html": "<p>Полностью достроены чаши. Возводится стенка биоплато.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_842a557995a52273092a6567103de2aa", "thumb": "", "name": "nn035.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_45b111d72c5513b4aac45e9ad22c2175", "thumb": "", "name": "nn034.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_acae93b38036ed543e7a0c608866b933", "thumb": "", "name": "nn033.jpg"}]}, {"id": 717, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-07-31", "html": "<p>Построено биоплато.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_3100f4c5f5807d8d330b988f21e38956", "thumb": "", "name": "nn038.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_49c99953478a7a6691ef71cacf8223e2", "thumb": "", "name": "nn037.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5c54b9641070b6fb16db7f3761da6330", "thumb": "", "name": "nn036.jpg"}]}, {"id": 723, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-08-01", "html": "<p>закончено изготовление бетонных конструктивов</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_8a1622eec2d2d7795e2c314330c6dd9d", "thumb": "", "name": "nn039.jpg"}]}, {"id": 729, "author": "PrU45f2Qj", "date": "2014-08-14", "html": "<p>Монтаж геотекстиля и гидроизоляции в рыбном водоеме</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/2_656aa2f91eae5c69c8709a3b676b18dc", "thumb": "", "name": "nn043.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_ba1bcc25979e7ab1d93211882cdf1803", "thumb": "", "name": "nn042.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_8111006a7deb52426f93851726b2d3b3", "thumb": "", "name": "nn041.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_20de0ffa05e49ada8f8dcb87dfa7aea1", "thumb": "", "name": "nn040.jpg"}]}, {"id": 732, "author": "PrU45f2Qj", "date": "2014-08-14", "html": "<p>Монтаж гидроизоляции. Первое заполнение водой</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/2_0f1209ff479a0b69c0db5749b4afd490", "thumb": "", "name": "nn047.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_53284057864f7781dbeccaba15b18dfc", "thumb": "", "name": "nn046.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_d0f559baaf195ab7f2b2cfea4e8aab33", "thumb": "", "name": "nn045.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_e442f4ca9b7e369c6b55c123ac847fa5", "thumb": "", "name": "nn044.jpg"}]}, {"id": 748, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-08-28", "html": "<p>Монтаж оборудования и начало декорации садового аквариума</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_c618d4bf4cd91cb600999aad3e2a5432", "thumb": "", "name": "nn050.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9133aefbfef14d62229e2a1d8e069dba", "thumb": "", "name": "nn049.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_87dbbe3c9a43c8604abdad9f3b446a51", "thumb": "", "name": "nn048.jpg"}]}, {"id": 753, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-09-01", "html": "<p>Запуск садового аквариума и декорация плавательного водоёма.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_5ad3fd147880dfcaf325f4bea534055a", "thumb": "", "name": "nn054.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fc9d68d0e1d02c2e95d5868249af03c0", "thumb": "", "name": "nn053.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_15036c5f83bc18d1bc790ae022a94eb8", "thumb": "", "name": "nn052.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_a37e56b8434b0a595bc4de693f3a89da", "thumb": "", "name": "nn051.jpg"}]}, {"id": 760, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-09-12", "html": "<p>Идут к завершению работы по строительству настила плавательного водоёма</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_8472687297d410bfd054d9d18de131d2", "thumb": "", "name": "nn055.jpg"}]}, {"id": 765, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-09-22", "html": "<p>Завершен монтаж настилов</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/2_56207fa6d64e33200d6f2579f0c58420", "thumb": "", "name": "nn057.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/2_9a52524322bedad35b89861fdbe968ec", "thumb": "", "name": "nn056.jpg"}]}, {"id": 797, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2014-10-22", "html": "<p>Плавательные водоёмы в зимнее время</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_aed7f82a65b1aa4046a5a5a95b0d3b6b", "thumb": "", "name": "nn058.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_63bc030380f721e554c8d00f71e5f956", "thumb": "", "name": "nn059.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_447bb5c6109ee0f4ed5c98cd2a9770d5", "thumb": "", "name": "nn060.jpg"}]}, {"id": 905, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-05-11", "html": "<p>Плавательный водоём перезимовал первую зиму.<br>Произведен весенний запуск.<br>Всё еще выглядит &quot;голым&quot;, но вода чистая!</p><p>Ждём, когда начнут расти водные растения.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_9fff67aaaba0314cce7af7b504fc24a2", "thumb": "", "name": "nn061.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_04a712ba9c320a5be01b193f30c1335f", "thumb": "", "name": "nn062.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d77c86e0ed403282570ff88e9d4653db", "thumb": "", "name": "nn063.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_19a509b46308dbe72b08b9356d10a888", "thumb": "", "name": "nn064.jpg"}]}, {"id": 961, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-06-16", "html": "<p>Появились первые обитатели садового аквариума.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f513709f0353ff44db7d608dc89f1753", "thumb": "", "name": "nn065.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_84f353a61341dd57cf507721f156d5be", "thumb": "", "name": "nn066.jpg"}]}, {"id": 980, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-07-03", "html": "<p>Посадка водных растений в зону регенерации</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_0eb3c26d5432a55a525e3fe5dd7e6970", "thumb": "", "name": "nn067.jpg"}]}, {"id": 998, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-07-20", "html": "<p>Прошло 3 недели после посадки растений</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_7498e0a489df4a6a3b0623a7d71c99b3", "thumb": "", "name": "nn068.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fe9c2e7a6d54989125c44c0804e88ceb", "thumb": "", "name": "nn069.jpg"}]}, {"id": 999, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-07-20", "html": "<p>Вот как выглядит вода при правильно спланированной системе!</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_fd47d36b02a7a5679c75c41399685267", "thumb": "", "name": "nn070.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_ff824b2f82f748da3c2b0e44e7162530", "thumb": "", "name": "nn071.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1036, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-08-24", "html": "<p>Садовый аквариум.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_c0584032821a2fbd6c5a6eee28226728", "thumb": "", "name": "nn072.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1040, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2015-08-26", "html": "<p>плавательный водоём и садовый аквариум в 2015</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_2885ee747c34e8d4df39a0c0968b6820", "thumb": "", "name": "nn073.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_2da38bf10b6babdaab2ad955f5e5b6a1", "thumb": "", "name": "nn074.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5af7b08a713dd5b61d037dd19523a795", "thumb": "", "name": "nn075.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_d932ff42247c61751ba655aaf31c66ef", "thumb": "", "name": "nn076.jpg"}]}, {"id": 1337, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2016-05-07", "html": "<p>Новый сезон 2016 начался!</p><p>Весенний запуск водоёма.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_f95c30d293b1c5a9496396a0f9a16225", "thumb": "", "name": "image-07-05-16-12-03.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_fadd3fd023bbc5e240d9334a58548a76", "thumb": "", "name": "image-07-05-16-12-03-2.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_e95c1df3e47b93530679879daa762635", "thumb": "", "name": "image-07-05-16-12-03-3.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f68667f58f98d600684fe66d17c153bf", "thumb": "", "name": "image-07-05-16-12-03-4.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 1438, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2016-08-12", "html": "<p>Плавательный водоём в Нижегородской области (п. Сергач), построенный компанией &quot;Гидрология&quot; в 2014 г. Вот как он выглядит летом 2016 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_067b78d6664db751f8b07c5205c688d1", "thumb": "", "name": "nn77.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_9e16e483de767683b9d5b813bb15a121", "thumb": "", "name": "nn78.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_dcb9d753fa61a8f7242b50e9fbf0161b", "thumb": "", "name": "nn79.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_f021237826567ebce7a4a526ef83478f", "thumb": "", "name": "nn80.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_3078ef58897c213f758941daf97c06a4", "thumb": "", "name": "nn81.jpeg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_28d57c02b03a6c251a8e002439493f30", "thumb": "", "name": "nn82.jpeg"}]}, {"id": 1531, "author": "Редактор", "date": "2016-12-22", "html": "<p>Обслуживание плавательного водоёма в 2016 г.</p>", "photos": [{"src": "/forum/files/57_8855c2d7e626fc0ff7c651612c2718b9", "thumb": "", "name": "nn083.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_68b6919492cf21e7048efc0526d5c91b", "thumb": "", "name": "nn084.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_85fd3bb662d1b3d532e9950873682bd2", "thumb": "", "name": "nn085.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5647eaa29dd7650a04eff2079801a017", "thumb": "", "name": "nn086.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_5cda017e0478ecccb3234d59680ce7d5", "thumb": "", "name": "nn087.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_7c12ac1860d4498378ccbf4ad1fba5d4", "thumb": "", "name": "nn088.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_433a2d062b67c026b43c195f50bf9188", "thumb": "", "name": "nn089.jpg"}, {"src": "/forum/files/57_edb1594b00c716ba6708b565b395a340", "thumb": "", "name": "nn090.jpg"}]}]}